{"type":"text","timestamp":1788383774429,"sessionID":"ses_f9c0a6ba5ffeg327dJ3UtwgaCa","part":{"id":"prt_063fab8da0010iG5zrWXABTbQZ","messageID":"msg_063fab6870010zHFbix7UgUTK1","sessionID":"ses_f9c0a6ba5ffeg327dJ3UtwgaCa","type":"text","text":"Implemented the full book collection REST API in TypeScript.\n\n**Stack:** Express + `better-sqlite3`, tested with Vitest + supertest.\n\n**Endpoints:** `GET /health`, `POST /books`, `GET /books` (with `?author=` case-insensitive partial filter), `GET /books/:id`, `PUT /books/:id`, `DELETE /books/:id` — all with appropriate JSON responses and HTTP status codes (`201`/`200`/`204`/`400`/`404`).\n\n**Validation:** title and author required (non-empty), year an integer within range, isbn optional — implemented in `src/validation.ts` with unit tests.\n\n**Files:**\n- `src/db.ts`, `src/validation.ts`, `src/app.ts`, `src/index.ts`\n- `tests/health.test.ts`, `tests/books.test.ts`, `tests/validation.test.ts`\n- `README.md` with setup/run/test instructions, `tsconfig.json`, `vitest.config.ts`\n\n**Verification:**\n- `npm run build` — compiles cleanly to `dist/`\n- `npm run typecheck` — passes for src and tests\n- `npx vitest run` — **3 files, 17 tests, all passing**\n- Live smoke test confirmed `200`/`201`/`400` responses and the author filter.\n\nRun with `npm start` (or `npm run dev`); configure via `PORT` and `DB_PATH` env vars (defaults: `3000`, `books.db`; use `DB_PATH=:memory:` for in-memory).","time":{"start":1788383770842,"end":1788383774423}}}
